            "id": 131190,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Bagaimana kamu mendefinisikan union type?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>type C = A | B;</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>type C = A &amp; B;</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>type C = A OR B;</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>type C = A | B;</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Lesson #3",
            "id": 130615,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Tambahkan tipe yang benar.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"typescript\" name=\"script.ts\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" colors: \" /><text value=\"string\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"[] = [\" /><text value=\"&quot;red&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;green&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;blue&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" firstColor = colors[\" /><text value=\"0\" class=\"number\" /><text value=\"];\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"console\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\".log(firstColor);\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"12\" endIndex=\"20\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"red\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Pastikan kamu mengetik <code>string[]</code>.</p></body></html>"
